Scope

This license covers the original work in this repository: the tools, scripts,
patches, documentation and analysis written for this project.

It does NOT cover, and grants no rights to:
- Fixel's FZ-1 ODE firmware, bootloader, FPGA bitstream or menu (boot.iso), or
  any file extracted from or generated from them (none are included here;
  tools/setup_from_official.py recreates them locally from the official release).
  Fixel's firmware license is listed as "TBD".

Third-party components keep their own licenses:
- source/lib/tinyusb/    TinyUSB, MIT (see its LICENSE)
- source/ff/             FatFs, ChaN's BSD-style license (see LICENSE.txt)
- docs/satato3do/        SataTo3DO by FCare, MIT (see its LICENSE)
- Pico SDK (not included, BSD-3-Clause)
